From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:13:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add runtime-fenced transaction pool coordinator and history
 index

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Add a runtime-fenced pool coordinator and separate derived LevelDB transaction history with exact confirmation and spend mappings. Atomic connect and undo batches and ambiguous-write tests establish local restart behavior; later corrections make initial catchup and pool reconstruction advance across small budgets.

